abstract: >-
  Research software for documented event-time and availability-time semantics,
  conservative public MIMIC-IV demo joins, decision-time-valid retrieval, and
  reproducible SQLite and MongoDB query evaluation. Not a clinical sepsis
  treatment recommendation or validated causal-effect estimator.
